      "content": "i know, i know, i should ask my doc but honestly i can't get an appointment for like two weeks and i'm miserable right now. i've taken lisinopril for years and my bp has been stable. how bad of an interaction are we really talking about? like is it actually dangerous or just something they tell everyone to be cautious about? i just need to breathe lol",
